This is source code to Axene Office 2.0.1, which was quietly released in 2003 under GPL Version 2.1. This repository is meant to be an archive of that original source code release.

The original binary release supported the following platforms.

OSF1 3.2 (Alpha)
HP-UX 10.20 (PA-RISC)
FreeBSD 2.2 (i386)
NetBSD 1.0 (i386)
SCO UNIX 3.2v4.2 (i386)
Linux 1.2 libc5 (i386)
Linux 2.0 libc6 (i386)
IRIX 5.3 (MIPS)
AIX 3.2.5 (RS/6000)
AIX 4.1.3 (RS/6000)
Linux 2.0 ELF (SPARC)
Solaris 2.5 (SPARC)
SunOS 4.1.4 (SPARC)
Solaris 2.4 (i386)

We will attempt to rebuild Axene Office for those platforms, where they are available.
The software had Motif as prerequisite. Where possible, we will use Motif 2.3.4 to build against the original platforms
or OpenMotif 2.1.30 when we need to use an older Motif version.

Eventually, there may be a branch to build this with modern compilers(2026) for current BSD and Linux distributions.

